     3	/**
     4	 * The policy base premium: the sum of the base premiums of all insured items.
     5	 *
     6	 * The office prices alike items as a group, so that the building-block offer can apply
     7	 * to each group in turn; the policy base premium is the sum of those group prices.
     8	 * Risk surcharges for individual items are not part of it -- they attach to the
     9	 * affected item, not to the policy.
